#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. デザイン的には普通だ。なぜか普通だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. It\n"
"looks normal. Just...totally normal.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now...on the other side of this camera, the\n"
"mastermind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、それももうすぐ終わりだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's gonna come to an end soon enough!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ぼくのとけいは、び・と・ん。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I just remembered, I used to have a Louie Vitan watch.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
